    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Slightly lower energy in the afternoons on androgen deprivation; weight up 0.6 kg; no fever or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Some difficulty hearing in noisy rooms</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, breathlessness, or sputum</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowels regular, about once a day, formed; no bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild urinary frequency, unchanged; no blood in the urine</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild morning knee stiffness; no bone pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, weakness, or numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 score 0; no change in memory or concentration</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild hot flashes three or four times a week on androgen deprivation; no breast tenderness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

